BIT-04: Cache terms that depend only on hydraulics, parameters and constants

Terms such as Re^0.88 or (4/D)*Kw*Kf/(Kw+Kf) depend only on a pipe's
hydraulics, parameters and constants, yet were recomputed for every segment
at every step. Find those terms and leading sub-expressions when the file is
read, and evaluate them once per pipe when its hydraulics change.

Requires: none
Results: identical (every concentration, the output file and the report are unchanged)

Apply from the root of an EPANET-MSX checkout at 85a303d, after FIX-01, FIX-02 and BIT-01 to BIT-03:
    git apply --whitespace=nowarn BIT-04.patch
or use tools/build-msx.sh, which applies the series in order.

